From ef10f33a108ef39667e0afa353fa701676d7b332 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 14:58:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] zx279128s: drop the fdt and tftp commands (task-90)

The E4 v3 budget needs the P1 reclaim: cmd/fdt.o is 8,166 text + 63
data and net/tftp.o is 4,137 text + 14 data.  Neither command is used by
the rescue page or the normal boot path - host-to-U-Boot transfers go
through the web rescue, and the serial loadx / e2631flash ladder is the
recovery channel - so both are compiled out here.

Measured from the UBOOT-SIZES of the task-84 build; the real number comes
from the task-92 rebuild.  CONFIG_NET_TFTP_VARS goes away with the tftp
command, which is expected.

Signed-off-by: QC3284 <2078725082@qq.com>
---
 configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig b/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
index 95886d66..5fd993bb 100644
--- a/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
+++ b/configs/zx279128s_zte_zxhn-e2631_defconfig
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ CONFIG_CONSOLE_RECORD_OUT_SIZE=0x4000
 # CONFIG_DISPLAY_CPUINFO is not set
 # CONFIG_BOARD_INIT is not set
 CONFIG_BOARD_LATE_INIT=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_FDT is not set
 # CONFIG_CMD_SAVEENV is not set
 CONFIG_CMD_MEMTEST=y
 CONFIG_CMD_MTD=y
@@ -29,6 +30,7 @@ CONFIG_CMD_MTD=y
 CONFIG_CMD_DHCP=y
 CONFIG_CMD_MII=y
 CONFIG_CMD_PING=y
+# CONFIG_CMD_TFTPBOOT is not set
 CONFIG_OF_CONTROL=y
 CONFIG_OF_EMBED=y
 CONFIG_ENV_IS_IN_MTD=y
